{"kp_id": "zj-041.kp0002", "video_id": "zj-041", "type": "concept_definition", "statement": "通谷为膀胱荥穴属水，与膀胱水经同属，故为本穴。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.bl66", "meridian.bl"], "chapter_id": "zj-041.c01", "evidence_quote": "通谷穴呢就是膀胱经的什么本穴", "seg_from": 4, "seg_to": 8, "start_s": 20.95, "end_s": 50.87, "citation": {"youtube_id": "XYv0BTmUpvc", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XYv0BTmUpvc&t=20s", "series": "zj", "episode": 41, "title": "Ni Hai-hsia \"Humanity Series\" - \"Acupuncture\" (90 Episodes Total): Acupuncture 41", "start_s": 20.95, "end_s": 50.87}, "confidence": 0.95, "asr_note": "容穴=荥穴", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-041.kp0003", "video_id": "zj-041", "type": "acupoint_usage", "statement": "至阴为井、补穴，痛甚常以委中代补井；特殊主治胎位不正（用一寸小针即可）。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.bl67", "acupoint.bl40"], "chapter_id": "zj-041.c01", "evidence_quote": "特殊的治症，就是胎位不正", "seg_from": 34, "seg_to": 38, "start_s": 200.58, "end_s": 232.445, "citation": {"youtube_id": "XYv0BTmUpvc", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XYv0BTmUpvc&t=200s", "series": "zj", "episode": 41, "title": "Ni Hai-hsia \"Humanity Series\" - \"Acupuncture\" (90 Episodes Total): Acupuncture 41", "start_s": 200.58, "end_s": 232.44}, "confidence": 0.95, "asr_note": "伪中=委中；资金/自营=至阴", "source": "llm_read"}
